#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for individuals who have some experience with "
"quantum computing and want to learn how to write variational algorithms "
"using IBM Quantum primitives. It is also suitable for quantum computing "
"professionals who want to expand their knowledge and skills in the field of "
"variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""

